<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Nutricia details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food group Nutricia NV said on Tuesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 135 held.</p>
<p>In March, Nutricia announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 3.20 guilders, of which 1.00 guilder had already been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Nutricia shares were trading at 294.10 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, up 0.30 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
